{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05 停留时间很短，Y 的大量感受文字又没有错峰出现，容易挤占注意力；这两段 X 更容易迅速扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的放大加亮关键词让我不必读完所有文字也能抓住每段转折，按音乐进程出现的感受又把亲近、克制、失落、释放和回望连成一段持续发展的经历，声音、身体和情绪细节也更具体。X 在解释人物为什么犹豫、为什么害怕、为什么又想退回去时更直接，短时间内读起来也更省力。但 X 右侧许多短词缺少明确的出现时机和彼此关系，听着音乐时不容易知道它们对应哪次情绪变化，因此整体体验仍是 Y 更好。\"\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7e420218-1186-4ba1-8eb4-b732af24f502", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T040908774560Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:09:52.342585+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "423436cc5028e3088391fd5f8316001c6a1199db3fa45cb2e7dcbd1b71441631", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach